{"title": "Elixir of Viciousness", "pageid": 10778, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Elixir_of_Viciousness", "categories": ["Elixirs", "Rare items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ELX_Elixir_of_Viciousness_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/ELX_Elixir_of_Viciousness_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Viciousness_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/0/00/ELX_Elixir_of_Viciousness_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Viciousness image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/00/ELX_Elixir_of_Viciousness_Faded.png/300px-ELX_Elixir_of_Viciousness_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/00/ELX_Elixir_of_Viciousness_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Elixir of Viciousness</span></a> is a rare <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Elixir\">Elixir</a> which reduces the number needed to roll a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> by 1.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The syrupy liquid languidly swirling inside this bottle somehow reminds you of a predator lying in wait.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/23px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/30px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixirs\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png/15px-Elixir_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Elixir_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixirs\" title=\"Elixirs\">Elixirs</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/38px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Single Use\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png/25px-Consumables_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Consumables_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Single Use</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.1 kg (0.2 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 50 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  50  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-efb838b8b4958cfbEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-bc8092aab70978baEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-2c42953a18b21dfaEND_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Criticals</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Criticals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Criticals\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">44cd95a7-4791-4ace-bea0-a5ca4421171b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:44cd95a7-4791-4ace-bea0-a5ca4421171b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:44cd95a7-4791-4ace-bea0-a5ca4421171b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Criticals</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Criticals+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ALCH_Solution_Elixir_Criticals+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"> <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a> </span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>The number you need to roll to land a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> is reduced by 1.\n<ul><li>Some class features reduce the <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> number; this elixir's effect is additive</li></ul></li>\n<li>Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Elixir_of_Viciousness\"> Condition: Elixir of Viciousness </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Viciousness_(Condition)\" title=\"Elixir of Viciousness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elixir of Viciousness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/POT_Potion_of_Everlasting_Vigour_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Viciousness_(Condition)\" title=\"Elixir of Viciousness (Condition)\">Elixir of Viciousness</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The number you need to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">roll</a> a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking is reduced by 1. This effect can stack. Replaces effects from other elixirs when drunk.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be crafted via <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy\" title=\"Alchemy\">Alchemy</a> by combining <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac\" title=\"Vitriol of Shadowroot Sac\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png/20px-Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png/30px-Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png/40px-Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png/20px-Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vitriol_of_Shadowroot_Sac\" title=\"Vitriol of Shadowroot Sac\">Vitriol of Shadowroot Sac</a> (procured from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowroot_Sac\" title=\"Shadowroot Sac\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png/20px-Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png/30px-Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png/40px-Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png/20px-Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Shadowroot_Sac_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowroot_Sac\" title=\"Shadowroot Sac\">Shadowroot Sac</a>) and any <a href=\"/wiki/Alchemy#Extractions\" title=\"Alchemy\">Ashes</a></li>\n<li>Can be sold by any merchant that has the <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_Table\" title=\"Elixir Table\">Elixir Table</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Table\" title=\"Potion Table\">Potion Table</a> <em>starting at level 6</em>; as stock is semi-random, merchants may have anywhere from 0 to 2</li></ul>\n</div>      \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 115.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 113.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Oil_of_Bane_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"In-game model\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Oil_of_Bane_Model.png/170px-Oil_of_Bane_Model.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Oil_of_Bane_Model.png/256px-Oil_of_Bane_Model.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/64/Oil_of_Bane_Model.png/341px-Oil_of_Bane_Model.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"In-game model\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Oil_of_Bane_Model.png/170px-Oil_of_Bane_Model.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"114\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Oil_of_Bane_Model.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></spa